    {
      "id": "8bf03a88-fb46-4694-9c20-2d724e5ee81d",
      "name": "Sticky Note ec07e82e",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-528, -112],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Intake & Validation\n\nTriggered by another workflow which already handles Mailchimp member upsert.\nExpected inputs: accountNo, accountName, email, source (must contain \"Fieldfolio\"), lastOrderDate, daysCooldown.\n\nValidate Input drops items with missing/invalid email or wrong source.\nNormalize Customer lowercases email, falls back to email for accountNo, stamps flow = \"Fieldfolio-Recovery\".",
        "color": 4,
        "width": 740,
        "height": 200
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a5f9cf63-aeb7-44f0-abd9-57a9359f5e37",
      "name": "Sticky Note 94fd5322",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, -144],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Engagement Tracker Lookup & Eligibility\n\nGoogle Sheets reads ALL rows for Flow=Fieldfolio-Recovery.\nEvaluate Eligibility (Code, runOnceForAllItems) matches each customer to their tracker row and decides (1-based steps):\n- new entry (no tracker row) => eligible, Step 1\n- Status Converted / Escalated => NOT eligible\n- Step >= 3 (3 emails already sent) => NOT eligible, promote to Unresponsive\n- LastEmailSent within daysCooldown => NOT eligible (cooldown)\n- else => eligible, Step + 1",
        "color": 5,
        "width": 740,
        "height": 280
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e07d6159-35ff-4676-bf15-b501d54d9aaf",
      "name": "Sticky Note f8c4f160",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1024, -96],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Tag & Track (Eligible Only)\n\nMember already exists in Mailchimp (upserted by the parent workflow).\nThis flow only:\n1. Adds tag Draft-Fieldfolio-Recovery -> Mailchimp campaign fires the next email\n2. Updates Engagement Tracker with Flow, Step (nextStep), LastEmailSent = now, Status (nextStatus)",
        "color": 3,
        "width": 740,
        "height": 200
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e7a043f8-c2ba-4ae5-85ab-011aad3a06c3",
